{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfb5 Five Hearts Under One Roof Season 2 Official Soundtrack</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks to all the love for Season 1\u2019s music,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >we\u2019re back with an even more emotional soundtrack for Season 2 \u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >crafted to let you relive those heart-fluttering moments through music.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Produced by 3Y Corporation,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >this album includes vocal tracks sung by the cast, as well as instrumental and piano versions that capture the atmosphere of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel the emotions of your favorite scenes once more, now through sound.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcbd Track List</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Cupid\u2019s Trick (\ub098 \uc0ac\uc2e4 \ub108 \uc88b\uc544\ud574)</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Cupid\u2019s Trick (Instrumental)</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Cupid\u2019s Trick (Piano)</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>My Heart for You (\ub108\ub97c \ubcf4\ub294 \ub098\uc758 \ub9c8\uc74c)</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>My Heart for You (Instrumental)</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfa7 Track Highlights</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>01. Cupid\u2019s Trick (\ub098 \uc0ac\uc2e4 \ub108 \uc88b\uc544\ud574)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The title song of Five Hearts Under One Roof Season 2, performed by Yunamong and Ppanggyul!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A refreshing love song that captures the thrill of a first crush and the fear of being found out \u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >its upbeat rhythm expresses both nervousness and excitement bursting from the heart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>02. My Heart for You (\ub108\ub97c \ubcf4\ub294 \ub098\uc758 \ub9c8\uc74c)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sung by Park Min Jung, who plays the idol character in the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A touching ballad that conveys the tender and bittersweet feelings of looking at someone you love.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Its soft melody and clear vocals create a deep emotional resonance.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3994370?t=1762753555","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3994370?t=1762753555","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994370/b207bc5fbb933aa9d5c7bf390ca9d5c84ded240e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762753555","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994370/b207bc5fbb933aa9d5c7bf390ca9d5c84ded240e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762753555","content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfb5 Five Hearts Under One Roof Season 2 Official Soundtrack</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks to all the love for Season 1\u2019s music,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >we\u2019re back with an even more emotional soundtrack for Season 2 \u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >crafted to let you relive those heart-fluttering moments through music.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Produced by 3Y Corporation,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >this album includes vocal tracks sung by the cast, as well as instrumental and piano versions that capture the atmosphere of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel the emotions of your favorite scenes once more, now through sound.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcbd Track List</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Cupid\u2019s Trick (\ub098 \uc0ac\uc2e4 \ub108 \uc88b\uc544\ud574)</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Cupid\u2019s Trick (Instrumental)</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Cupid\u2019s Trick (Piano)</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>My Heart for You (\ub108\ub97c \ubcf4\ub294 \ub098\uc758 \ub9c8\uc74c)</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>My Heart for You (Instrumental)</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfa7 Track Highlights</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>01. Cupid\u2019s Trick (\ub098 \uc0ac\uc2e4 \ub108 \uc88b\uc544\ud574)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The title song of Five Hearts Under One Roof Season 2, performed by Yunamong and Ppanggyul!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A refreshing love song that captures the thrill of a first crush and the fear of being found out \u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >its upbeat rhythm expresses both nervousness and excitement bursting from the heart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>02. My Heart for You (\ub108\ub97c \ubcf4\ub294 \ub098\uc758 \ub9c8\uc74c)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sung by Park Min Jung, who plays the idol character in the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A touching ballad that conveys the tender and bittersweet feelings of looking at someone you love.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Its soft melody and clear vocals create a deep emotional resonance.</p>","developers":["Storytaco","3Y CORPORATION"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3731020","name":"Five Hearts Under One Roof season2"},"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994370/2435b60fa411428b9ab7b63fb72fb07b6de262ad/header.jpg?t=1762753555","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstat